{"vid":"EvmLGcmiRpA","source":"EvmLGcmiRpA.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":11.8,"txt":"Should auld acquaintance be forgot, and never brought to mind?"},{"t":23.7,"txt":"Should auld acquaintance be forgot, and days of auld lang syne?"},{"t":36.4,"txt":"For auld lang syne, my dear, for auld lang syne,"},{"t":47.5,"txt":"we’ll tak' a cup o’ kindness yet, for auld lang syne."},{"t":63.7,"txt":"We twa hae run about the braes, and pou’d the gowans fine;"},{"t":75.7,"txt":"But we’ve wander’d mony a weary fit, sin' auld lang syne."},{"t":87.4,"txt":"We twa hae paidl’d in the burn, frae morning sun till dine;"},{"t":99.3,"txt":"But seas between us braid hae roar’d sin' auld lang syne."},{"t":109.1,"txt":"For auld lang syne, my dear, for auld lang syne,"},{"t":114.7,"txt":"we’ll tak' a cup o’ kindness yet, for auld lang syne."},{"t":178.3,"txt":"And surely ye’ll be your pint-stowp! and surely I’ll be mine!"},{"t":196.9,"txt":"And we’ll tak' a cup o’ kindness yet, for auld lang syne."},{"t":208.3,"txt":"And there’s a hand, my trusty fiere! and gie's a hand o’ thine!"},{"t":221.4,"txt":"And we’ll tak' a right gude-willie waught, for auld lang syne."},{"t":233.9,"txt":"For auld lang syne, my dear, for auld lang syne,"},{"t":245.2,"txt":"we’ll tak' a cup o’ kindness yet, for auld lang syne."},{"t":253.2,"txt":"For auld lang syne, my dear, for auld lang syne,"},{"t":270.1,"txt":"we’ll tak' a cup o’ kindness yet, for auld lang syne."}],"words":[{"t":11.84,"w":"Should"},{"t":11.84,"w":"auld"},{"t":11.84,"w":"acquaintance"},{"t":11.84,"w":"be"},{"t":11.84,"w":"forgot,"},{"t":11.84,"w":"and"},{"t":11.84,"w":"never"},{"t":11.84,"w":"brought"},{"t":11.84,"w":"to"},{"t":11.84,"w":"mind?"},{"t":23.74,"w":"Should"},{"t":23.74,"w":"auld"},{"t":23.74,"w":"acquaintance"},{"t":23.74,"w":"be"},{"t":23.74,"w":"forgot,"},{"t":23.74,"w":"and"},{"t":23.74,"w":"days"},{"t":23.74,"w":"of"},{"t":23.74,"w":"auld"},{"t":23.74,"w":"lang"},{"t":23.74,"w":"syne?"},{"t":36.38,"w":"For"},{"t":36.38,"w":"a